WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.187 --> 01:37.953
=Episode 23=

01:38.000 --> 01:39.913
(Xie Residence)

01:39.960 --> 01:41.561
You again?

01:41.880 --> 01:43.240
If you're really that sincere,

01:43.360 --> 01:45.281
go pray to a real Buddha at the temple.

01:45.440 --> 01:46.880
Instead, every few days

01:46.880 --> 01:48.360
you come throwing yourself at Miss Xie.

01:48.360 --> 01:49.600
What do you think you're doing?

01:49.600 --> 01:50.281
Sanniang.

01:51.080 --> 01:51.960
Miss Xie,

01:52.281 --> 01:53.401
I came here today

01:53.600 --> 01:54.761
because I want an answer.

01:55.960 --> 01:58.240
I don't want to be some caged bird
kept for a man's amusement,

01:58.520 --> 01:59.921
trapped on a lacquered perch,

02:00.880 --> 02:02.440
expected only to bear children
and repay his favor.

02:03.761 --> 02:05.080
If you were in my place,

02:05.201 --> 02:06.160
what would you do?

02:06.960 --> 02:07.761
I know

02:08.160 --> 02:09.801
I could never compare to you.

02:10.401 --> 02:12.160
I've lived at the mercy of others
since I was a child.

02:13.320 --> 02:14.361
But now,

02:15.401 --> 02:16.561
I don't want to endure it anymore.

02:19.401 --> 02:20.361
Miss Xie,

02:20.600 --> 02:22.281
please show me a way out.

02:54.401 --> 02:55.401
For five years,

02:56.920 --> 02:58.801
I haven't eaten a single grain of rice.

03:01.040 --> 03:02.401
Even with vegetables,

03:03.640 --> 03:05.640
I'm allowed no more
than three bites per meal.

03:06.760 --> 03:08.121
Aunt always says

03:08.521 --> 03:09.720
a woman's marriage

03:09.720 --> 03:11.081
is impossible to predict.

03:12.561 --> 03:14.401
Who knows whether my future husband

03:15.160 --> 03:16.920
will prefer a fuller figure

03:17.961 --> 03:19.521
or a slender one?

03:20.160 --> 03:21.760
If I'm kept thin now,

03:22.320 --> 03:23.760
I can always put on weight later.

03:23.920 --> 03:24.961
That's easy enough.

03:26.040 --> 03:28.361
But if I'm allowed to grow plump,

03:29.880 --> 03:31.521
losing the weight later

03:32.001 --> 03:33.401
would be much harder.

03:33.920 --> 03:34.880
Miss Xie,

03:35.401 --> 03:36.281
do you know

03:36.281 --> 03:38.320
how I've survived all these years?

03:38.760 --> 03:40.640
Every day, I prayed to heaven

03:41.200 --> 03:42.640
to give me a husband

03:42.640 --> 03:44.361
who likes fuller women.

03:45.521 --> 03:46.200
Then maybe

03:46.401 --> 03:48.160
I could finally eat my fill.

04:17.440 --> 04:19.041
My mother once told me,

04:20.161 --> 04:22.320
a woman may be better off going
through life unaware.

04:23.080 --> 04:24.440
At least then, she can live in peace.

04:24.801 --> 04:26.041
Once she sees the world for what it is,

04:26.960 --> 04:29.080
there will be no end to her troubles.

04:30.481 --> 04:31.640
Do you truly want to know?

04:40.041 --> 04:41.681
I too was once treated like a prize
to be bargained over.

04:42.760 --> 04:43.880
Back then,

04:44.400 --> 04:45.561
every step felt like walking
on thin ice.

04:49.280 --> 04:51.121
Every time I was weighed and judged,

04:51.880 --> 04:53.041
I had to keep my eyes open

04:53.440 --> 04:54.561
and be extremely careful,

04:55.041 --> 04:55.760
or risk

04:56.041 --> 04:57.241
being trapped for good.

04:57.561 --> 04:59.721
Then how did you become
who you are today?

05:00.921 --> 05:01.960
Along the way,

05:02.960 --> 05:05.200
I was fortunate to have
Commander Zhao by my side.

05:07.760 --> 05:09.200
But it wasn't until I broke free

05:09.440 --> 05:11.200
from the walls of the inner household

05:12.681 --> 05:14.241
that I saw how vast the world truly was

05:15.041 --> 05:16.921
and understood what I truly wanted.

05:17.400 --> 05:19.440
Marriage may change your circumstances,

05:20.080 --> 05:21.041
but true freedom

05:21.481 --> 05:23.121
is something you must
find within yourself.

05:27.320 --> 05:28.400
Go home.

05:28.960 --> 05:29.760
This time,

05:30.001 --> 05:31.960
I'll find a way to protect you
from this.

05:34.320 --> 05:35.481
Thank you, Miss Xie.

05:38.907 --> 05:39.867
(Wanfang Garden)

05:39.921 --> 05:41.320
You rarely come to visit me.

05:41.440 --> 05:43.121
You must stay for a few rounds
of cards before you leave.

05:43.200 --> 05:44.520
Go find us a few more players.

05:45.041 --> 05:45.640
Yes.

05:46.520 --> 05:48.921
You wear those cat's-eye earrings

05:48.921 --> 05:49.921
quite often.

05:50.241 --> 05:51.241
I've noticed

05:51.241 --> 05:52.760
you have
so many beautiful hairpieces and jewelry

05:52.760 --> 05:54.320
and wear a different one every day.

05:54.561 --> 05:56.200
Why are you so attached to this pair?

05:56.400 --> 05:57.481
Nothing gets past you.

05:58.080 --> 05:59.400
My husband found these for me

05:59.400 --> 06:00.481
when he came to serve in the capital.

06:00.481 --> 06:02.280
They're a Western trinket
he specially sought out.

06:02.880 --> 06:04.280
He even said these earrings

06:04.400 --> 06:06.520
would go perfectly with my favorite
pomegranate-red dress

06:06.960 --> 06:08.121
and flatter my complexion.

06:11.080 --> 06:12.280
Something's on your mind?

06:14.880 --> 06:16.320
Just now at the jewelry shop,

06:16.520 --> 06:17.880
I saw the shopkeeper

06:17.880 --> 06:19.601
wrapping up an identical pair.

06:19.880 --> 06:21.801
He said Madam Wu had ordered
them some time ago

06:21.801 --> 06:23.041
and specifically requested

06:23.041 --> 06:24.801
a pomegranate-red brocade box.

06:34.334 --> 06:36.273
(Double Happiness)

06:39.001 --> 06:40.121
What did you learn

06:40.361 --> 06:41.400
at home?

06:42.041 --> 06:43.280
I can read a little.

06:43.760 --> 06:45.121
I've only studied women's texts

06:45.280 --> 06:46.320
and learned a little painting.

06:46.561 --> 06:47.601
No wonder.

06:48.440 --> 06:49.640
Women who paint

06:49.921 --> 06:52.001
do tend to have such delicate hands.

07:22.685 --> 07:24.491
(Double Happiness)

07:26.041 --> 07:26.801
Madam,

07:26.801 --> 07:27.320
that's

07:27.440 --> 07:28.561
Master's carriage.

07:38.880 --> 07:39.880
Come closer.

07:57.280 --> 07:57.760
Move!

07:57.880 --> 07:58.320
Where is he?

07:58.320 --> 07:58.960
Madam Wei!

07:59.200 --> 07:59.801
Madam Wei!

08:00.161 --> 08:00.921
Madam Wei!

08:00.921 --> 08:01.481
Move!

08:01.481 --> 08:02.241
Wei Donglin!

08:04.080 --> 08:05.121
Wei Donglin!

08:05.121 --> 08:05.640
Wei Donglin!

08:05.640 --> 08:06.801
What are you doing here?

08:06.801 --> 08:08.041
You scumbag!

08:08.280 --> 08:09.601
Were you raised with no manners at all?

08:09.921 --> 08:11.400
Weren't you supposed to be dining
with your colleagues?

08:11.561 --> 08:13.241
How did you end up
in this seductress's bed?

08:13.241 --> 08:14.041
I...

08:14.041 --> 08:15.161
I haven't even gotten into bed.

08:15.161 --> 08:16.520
Nothing's happened yet.

08:16.520 --> 08:17.121
You...

08:21.041 --> 08:21.640
Stop right there!

08:25.280 --> 08:26.960
Dressed up awfully festive, aren't you?

08:27.320 --> 08:29.121
Strip that shameless woman!

08:29.121 --> 08:29.601
Madam!

08:30.400 --> 08:31.121
Take it off!

08:31.121 --> 08:31.760
You can't do this.

08:31.760 --> 08:32.760
Please, don't!

08:32.961 --> 08:33.601
My Lady!

08:34.001 --> 08:34.800
My Lady!

08:35.680 --> 08:36.441
My Lady!

08:37.321 --> 08:38.640
You shameless wretch!

08:39.321 --> 08:41.481
Do you even know your place?

08:41.481 --> 08:42.721
Look at where you come from.

08:43.160 --> 08:45.160
You truly are a born wretch.

08:46.400 --> 08:47.520
You dare to laugh?

08:52.560 --> 08:54.920
Then I'll give you something
to laugh about!

08:59.400 --> 09:00.721
I'd like to see,

09:01.880 --> 09:03.640
without this pretty face of yours,

09:04.001 --> 09:06.280
how you'll manage to seduce
another woman's husband.

09:06.441 --> 09:07.081
Madam Wei!

09:07.280 --> 09:08.400
Please, don't!

09:08.601 --> 09:09.321
Madam Wei.

09:09.400 --> 09:10.441
If this gets out of hand,

09:10.441 --> 09:11.520
it won't look good for you either.

09:11.520 --> 09:12.400
Let go of me!

09:12.481 --> 09:13.400
Lord Wei,

09:13.400 --> 09:14.800
do you still want this woman or not?

09:14.800 --> 09:15.441
Enough!

09:16.321 --> 09:17.441
Who are you telling "enough"?

09:17.920 --> 09:19.280
You raised your voice at me?

09:19.280 --> 09:20.160
I didn't.

09:20.160 --> 09:21.321
Since we got married,

09:21.520 --> 09:23.241
you've never once shouted at me.

09:23.241 --> 09:23.920
I...

09:24.121 --> 09:25.640
And today, for some cheap woman,

09:25.640 --> 09:26.560
you shouted at me!

09:26.560 --> 09:27.241
My dear!

09:27.241 --> 09:29.201
I... I didn't!

09:29.280 --> 09:30.081
Fine!

09:30.201 --> 09:32.081
Looks like you've made up your mind
to be with her.

09:32.081 --> 09:33.441
- No!
- Then I'll give you both what you want!

09:33.520 --> 09:34.721
I'll end our marriage!

09:34.880 --> 09:35.800
No, you won't!

09:35.800 --> 09:37.280
Let's see which of us can live
without the other.

09:37.280 --> 09:38.241
I can't live without you!

09:38.241 --> 09:39.321
I can't live without you.

09:39.321 --> 09:40.441
What great household

09:40.441 --> 09:41.961
doesn't have a mistress or two
on the side?

09:41.961 --> 09:42.920
I'm lowborn,

09:42.920 --> 09:43.920
and yes, I have no shame.

09:44.400 --> 09:45.680
But you're different, Madam Wei.

09:46.001 --> 09:47.121
You're a lady of standing.

09:47.361 --> 09:48.441
If this scandal gets out,

09:48.920 --> 09:50.040
you're the one who'll lose face.

09:50.040 --> 09:51.680
How dare you talk back to me!

09:51.680 --> 09:53.121
You've got some nerve!

09:54.400 --> 09:55.040
My Lady!

09:55.160 --> 09:56.520
This is no place for you to speak.

09:56.520 --> 09:57.920
Apologize to Madam Wei at once.

09:58.361 --> 09:59.441
I was wrong.

10:00.321 --> 10:01.361
But this whole mess

10:01.441 --> 10:02.680
isn't mine alone to answer for.

10:02.680 --> 10:03.680
It's all because of your dear friend.

10:03.680 --> 10:04.880
Young Madam Yu taught me everything.

10:04.880 --> 10:05.400
Shut up!

10:05.800 --> 10:07.241
Young Madam Yu is a lady of standing.

10:07.241 --> 10:08.280
How dare you slander her!

10:08.441 --> 10:10.121
You must have a death wish.

10:10.760 --> 10:11.520
Madam Wei,

10:11.601 --> 10:12.441
Lord Wei,

10:12.680 --> 10:14.160
she's talking nonsense.

10:14.241 --> 10:15.241
Just you wait.

10:16.040 --> 10:17.040
When the time comes,

10:17.280 --> 10:19.081
I'll settle accounts with both you
and your niece.

10:20.481 --> 10:21.361
We're going home.

10:22.441 --> 10:22.961
Let's go.

10:32.001 --> 10:32.601
Was she

10:33.321 --> 10:34.520
the one you brought here?

10:40.321 --> 10:41.121
Aunt,

10:41.441 --> 10:42.400
how would I dare?

10:42.400 --> 10:43.680
I only said those things

10:43.961 --> 10:45.520
for Madam Wei to hear,

10:45.520 --> 10:46.721
just to get her to leave.

10:46.800 --> 10:48.481
That's why I spoke so recklessly.

10:50.680 --> 10:51.520
Does it hurt?

10:54.481 --> 10:56.001
In a city as dangerous as the capital,

10:56.001 --> 10:57.400
without me,

10:57.760 --> 10:59.680
you'd be dead already.

11:01.040 --> 11:01.680
Cairong.

11:01.961 --> 11:03.241
See that she gets some rest.

11:03.241 --> 11:04.241
Without my permission,

11:04.880 --> 11:06.361
she is not to leave this room.

11:06.361 --> 11:07.121
Yes.

11:15.280 --> 11:16.040
Young Madam!

11:16.361 --> 11:17.121
Young Madam!

11:17.121 --> 11:17.760
Young Madam!

11:18.121 --> 11:19.121
What's the rush?

11:19.121 --> 11:20.441
Madam Wei forced her way in.

11:20.441 --> 11:21.441
I couldn't stop her.

11:26.201 --> 11:26.920
Wanyi.

11:27.361 --> 11:29.081
What brings you here today?

11:34.081 --> 11:34.721
Young Madam.

11:38.201 --> 11:40.241
(Wei Family Accounts)
What I paid for writing supplies

11:40.721 --> 11:42.201
3 months ago, your share
of expenses for the literary gatherings,

11:42.481 --> 11:43.721
and the travel money

11:43.721 --> 11:45.160
I set aside for your father.

11:45.601 --> 11:46.481
It's all here.

11:47.520 --> 11:48.280
Today,

11:48.560 --> 11:50.081
we settle everything between us.

11:54.441 --> 11:55.241
Wanyi,

11:56.160 --> 11:57.601
why are you saying this?

11:58.201 --> 12:00.361
I was a little short
with you the other day

12:00.361 --> 12:01.441
because of the official post.

12:01.520 --> 12:02.081
But

12:02.601 --> 12:04.361
it's only because I see you
as my dearest friend

12:04.601 --> 12:06.321
that I speak so openly with you.

12:09.441 --> 12:10.640
"My dearest friend"?

12:12.040 --> 12:14.241
Then tell me, what kind of dear friend

12:15.081 --> 12:16.920
plants a mistress in her friend's
husband's bed?

12:19.121 --> 12:20.121
Wanyi,

12:20.721 --> 12:22.081
don't wrong me.

12:24.081 --> 12:25.241
There's nothing false about it.

12:26.400 --> 12:28.280
You came from humble origins.

12:28.481 --> 12:29.601
Everything you have today

12:30.560 --> 12:32.961
came through shady means.

12:33.760 --> 12:35.001
Same methods,

12:35.441 --> 12:36.961
same kind of woman.

12:48.601 --> 12:49.441
Madam Wei,

12:50.361 --> 12:51.601
don't look down on me.

12:52.201 --> 12:54.520
Your mother-in-law prays
in the shrine every day,

12:54.961 --> 12:56.680
hoping for another grandson.

12:57.280 --> 12:58.760
You can't give her a son,

12:59.121 --> 13:00.361
yet you insist on making a scene.

13:00.800 --> 13:02.441
Whose reputation
do you think that hurts?

13:06.961 --> 13:08.800
So you've finally dropped the act?

13:09.601 --> 13:11.201
You call yourself my friend

13:11.760 --> 13:13.441
while waiting to see me humiliated.

13:14.481 --> 13:16.081
I can weather a scandal.

13:16.160 --> 13:17.121
Can you?

13:18.081 --> 13:19.560
The Yu family took you in once.

13:19.721 --> 13:21.880
They can take in another woman
just as easily.

13:23.201 --> 13:23.680
I...

13:25.241 --> 13:25.880
Oh, and one more thing.

13:27.481 --> 13:28.961
I host literary gatherings

13:29.040 --> 13:30.441
because I enjoy them.

13:31.001 --> 13:33.081
You spend twenty taels every month.

13:33.560 --> 13:34.481
Is it all just

13:34.481 --> 13:36.441
so people will call you a talented lady?

13:38.441 --> 13:39.241
If I were you,

13:39.680 --> 13:42.001
I'd focus on holding on to your son.

13:42.920 --> 13:44.520
After all, without his protection,

13:46.441 --> 13:47.920
you're nothing.

13:56.137 --> 13:56.656
(Wei Family Accounts)

14:28.201 --> 14:29.361
Biao told me

14:30.001 --> 14:31.121
Sen has been

14:32.040 --> 14:33.040
planning to take
the military examination.

14:35.001 --> 14:36.321
Those who excel
in the written strategy exam

14:36.481 --> 14:37.760
can receive better appointments

14:38.560 --> 14:39.520
even if their martial skills
are only average.

14:40.280 --> 14:40.880
But he

14:42.121 --> 14:43.201
keeps skipping lessons.

14:44.121 --> 14:44.961
He won't listen to me.

14:45.441 --> 14:46.321
When you have time,

14:47.800 --> 14:48.601
talk some sense into him for me.

14:51.520 --> 14:53.040
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

14:53.441 --> 14:54.760
He's eighteen now.

14:55.321 --> 14:56.160
He's grown up.

15:00.994 --> 15:03.741
(To Zhang, Minister of Personnel)

15:05.040 --> 15:05.920
What's this?

15:07.280 --> 15:08.481
I passed by the Ministry of Personnel
the other day

15:08.880 --> 15:09.880
and happened to see it.

15:10.481 --> 15:11.481
So I brought it along.

15:14.337 --> 15:15.396
(Shen Congsi is well versed
in practical affairs.)

15:15.396 --> 15:17.023
(I beseech Your Majesty to appoint
him Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor.)

15:18.920 --> 15:19.760
Mr. Zhao, I...

15:19.760 --> 15:20.640
As for Sen,

15:21.040 --> 15:22.280
if you don't want to get involved,

15:25.961 --> 15:27.280
just tell me.

15:34.760 --> 15:35.560
I understand.

15:40.583 --> 15:43.257
(Shen Congsi is well versed
in practical affairs.)

15:55.680 --> 15:57.601
What did Mr. Zhao

15:58.241 --> 15:59.800
mean by that just now?

16:00.160 --> 16:01.441
So with Sen,

16:01.961 --> 16:03.201
are you going to help him

16:03.560 --> 16:04.880
or not?

16:06.361 --> 16:08.040
He wasn't trying to control Sen.

16:08.481 --> 16:10.640
He was warning me about Shen Congsi.

16:13.001 --> 16:14.201
It seems Mr. Zhao

16:14.961 --> 16:16.361
doesn't want to go
against His Majesty's wishes

16:16.880 --> 16:18.081
and intends to side with the reformists.

16:19.640 --> 16:21.321
But the northwest's fate hangs on this.

16:22.961 --> 16:23.920
We can't

16:24.920 --> 16:26.121
just let this go.

16:28.640 --> 16:30.361
We need to find a way
to break the deadlock.

16:31.640 --> 16:32.280
Miss Xie,

16:33.241 --> 16:34.201
Madam Wei is here.

16:35.601 --> 16:37.880
I threw away those cat's-eye earrings

16:37.880 --> 16:38.920
from last time.

16:39.321 --> 16:40.441
They really did

16:40.441 --> 16:42.081
taint my jewelry box.

16:43.880 --> 16:44.560
Tingyun,

16:45.201 --> 16:47.001
if you ever need anything from me,

16:47.241 --> 16:48.800
just say the word.

16:49.241 --> 16:50.760
I'm grateful you don't think
me meddlesome, Madam.

16:50.760 --> 16:51.760
That's more than enough.

16:52.001 --> 16:53.241
I didn't help you expecting anything
in return.

16:54.961 --> 16:56.241
A favor from me

16:56.241 --> 16:57.760
is worth more than gold.

16:57.880 --> 16:59.280
Are you sure you don't want it?

17:00.121 --> 17:01.400
To be honest, that day,

17:01.800 --> 17:03.280
when I tipped you off,

17:03.560 --> 17:05.201
I wasn't plotting anything.

17:05.800 --> 17:07.320
I simply felt sorry

17:07.520 --> 17:08.800
for Miss Wu

17:09.280 --> 17:10.441
and wanted to help her.

17:11.360 --> 17:12.441
I didn't expect

17:12.600 --> 17:14.520
you to be so refreshingly
straightforward.

17:15.360 --> 17:17.401
Then I won't hide anything
from you either.

17:17.760 --> 17:18.721
This time,

17:18.800 --> 17:20.600
owing you a favor is the least of it.

17:21.280 --> 17:22.441
Thanks to you,

17:22.800 --> 17:23.961
I finally saw

17:23.961 --> 17:25.921
just how ruthless Young Madam Yu can be.

17:27.241 --> 17:28.401
It's just a pity

17:28.800 --> 17:30.641
she can't see beyond what's right
in front of her.

17:31.080 --> 17:33.161
She tried to ruin me out of spite,

17:33.481 --> 17:34.600
but if I ruin her,

17:34.760 --> 17:36.681
I can bring down the entire
Yu family's foundation.

17:37.520 --> 17:38.241
By the way,

17:39.120 --> 17:40.520
aren't you trying to secure

17:40.520 --> 17:43.080
the post of Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor?

17:43.560 --> 17:44.760
I can help you

17:44.881 --> 17:45.961
get Yu Jingxiu

17:45.961 --> 17:47.001
taken out of the running.

17:54.560 --> 17:55.681
In that case,

17:56.921 --> 17:58.360
could I trouble you

17:58.520 --> 18:00.481
to put this man's name forward instead?

18:04.258 --> 18:05.732
(Shen is good in practical affairs.
I beseech to appoint him Salt Censor.)

18:05.760 --> 18:07.161
Shen Congsi?

18:09.040 --> 18:11.441
Isn't Commander Zhao
overseeing the salt reform?

18:12.080 --> 18:14.080
Why ask me to recommend someone
instead of him?

18:15.481 --> 18:16.520
I see.

18:16.520 --> 18:18.921
Commander Zhao must not agree with you.

18:22.520 --> 18:23.721
What he thinks

18:24.241 --> 18:25.201
certainly matters,

18:25.881 --> 18:27.401
but I can't give up

18:27.401 --> 18:28.441
what I believe in.

18:30.800 --> 18:32.001
I didn't realize

18:32.001 --> 18:32.921
you had

18:32.921 --> 18:34.481
such a mind of your own.

18:35.080 --> 18:36.001
But

18:36.001 --> 18:38.280
a woman should stand her ground.

18:38.760 --> 18:40.360
Otherwise, one day

18:40.600 --> 18:42.001
Commander Zhao

18:42.320 --> 18:44.040
might just have a pair

18:44.201 --> 18:46.040
of cat's-eye earrings made for you too.

18:48.161 --> 18:49.961
No tea today.

18:50.241 --> 18:51.441
Bring us some wine.

18:51.760 --> 18:52.881
Allow me, Wanyi.

18:54.320 --> 18:55.001
Sanniang,

18:55.280 --> 18:56.881
bring out the best wine

18:56.881 --> 18:57.600
we have in the house.

18:58.201 --> 18:59.080
Today,

18:59.241 --> 19:00.280
Wanyi and I

19:00.280 --> 19:01.201
are drinking to our hearts' content.

19:06.320 --> 19:08.401
For the post
of Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor,

19:08.721 --> 19:10.600
the Ministry of Personnel
and the Censorate

19:10.600 --> 19:11.280
have submitted candidates

19:11.280 --> 19:12.080
and reviewed them.

19:12.241 --> 19:13.280
We now have our selections.

19:13.303 --> 19:14.223
(I respectfully add Yu Jingxiu
to the list.)

19:14.241 --> 19:16.080
In addition to Commander Zhao's list,

19:16.083 --> 19:16.670
(Shen Congsi)

19:16.681 --> 19:17.520
I have

19:17.600 --> 19:18.881
two more candidates.

19:19.401 --> 19:20.401
They are

19:20.401 --> 19:22.040
Yu Jingxiu, the top scholar

19:22.161 --> 19:23.080
of the First Class,

19:23.360 --> 19:24.721
and Shen Congsi,

19:24.881 --> 19:26.080
a Third-Class scholar.

19:29.441 --> 19:31.597
Shen Congsi?

19:35.401 --> 19:36.800
Why have I heard

19:37.360 --> 19:38.760
that his reputation is rather poor?

19:39.120 --> 19:40.401
Some say

19:40.401 --> 19:41.800
his talent has made him arrogant
and unruly.

19:42.320 --> 19:43.641
Others say

19:43.641 --> 19:45.201
he has no respect for rules.

19:52.241 --> 19:52.760
Your Majesty,

19:53.001 --> 19:53.961
Master Zhao is here.

19:56.441 --> 19:57.641
Master Zhao.

19:58.120 --> 19:59.760
It's been a long time since he came
to the palace.

20:00.441 --> 20:01.120
That will be

20:01.120 --> 20:02.120
all for today.

20:03.201 --> 20:05.001
Court is dismissed!

20:05.001 --> 20:06.641
Farewell, Your Majesty.

20:12.280 --> 20:14.600
Shen Congsi is bold and forthright,

20:14.881 --> 20:16.320
but above all, he is upright
and incorruptible.

20:17.241 --> 20:18.681
He gave others grounds for criticism

20:18.881 --> 20:20.320
because of this essay.

20:21.080 --> 20:22.961
His writing was admittedly
rather provocative,

20:22.961 --> 20:23.760
but in truth,

20:24.320 --> 20:26.881
he was speaking up for scholars
from humble families.

20:27.800 --> 20:29.320
Prejudice can indeed blind people.

20:29.760 --> 20:32.241
Your Majesty nearly overlooked
a capable man.

20:33.800 --> 20:35.161
You rarely come to the palace, Master.

20:35.320 --> 20:36.681
Did you come merely to recommend a man?

20:38.441 --> 20:39.520
Your Majesty chose

20:39.641 --> 20:40.721
to reform the salt system

20:40.921 --> 20:42.280
because the treasury is depleted

20:42.280 --> 20:43.241
and urgently needs revenue.

20:43.721 --> 20:45.481
You chose Zhao Ling to lead the charge,

20:46.441 --> 20:49.120
no doubt because of his swift
and forceful methods.

20:49.320 --> 20:50.040
But

20:50.161 --> 20:51.520
a sudden downpour
can flatten young crops.

20:51.800 --> 20:52.881
Such force can easily go too far.

20:54.201 --> 20:55.441
I would advise

20:55.721 --> 20:57.441
placing someone more moderate

20:57.441 --> 20:59.001
at Zhao Ling's side.

20:59.721 --> 21:01.040
If the two balance each other well,

21:01.360 --> 21:02.441
Your Majesty can then

21:02.560 --> 21:03.921
remain firmly in control.

21:05.080 --> 21:05.961
Interesting.

21:06.401 --> 21:07.560
Then I shall see

21:07.560 --> 21:08.721
whether Shen Congsi

21:08.721 --> 21:09.881
can truly

21:09.881 --> 21:11.120
practice what he preaches.

21:17.040 --> 21:17.760
Master Zhao.

21:25.600 --> 21:27.161
If His Majesty asks you to choose later,

21:27.241 --> 21:28.201
don't actually choose.

21:29.241 --> 21:30.800
Don't let personal preferences

21:30.800 --> 21:31.881
or grudges sway you.

21:32.520 --> 21:33.641
Don't let emotion cloud your judgment.

21:37.800 --> 21:38.800
Thank you, Master Zhao.

21:46.618 --> 21:48.280
(Zhang Bo'an; Yu Jingxiu; Shen Congsi)

21:48.286 --> 21:49.077
(Candidates for the Vacant Post
of Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor)

21:50.120 --> 21:51.560
Look over these names.

21:51.560 --> 21:52.441
Tell me

21:52.441 --> 21:53.961
whom you'd prefer to work with.

21:54.401 --> 21:55.600
I believe

22:00.881 --> 22:02.401
the decision is entirely Your Majesty's.

22:04.201 --> 22:05.921
I was too eager for quick results before

22:06.040 --> 22:07.560
and nearly overlooked a capable man.

22:08.441 --> 22:09.560
I'd like to see

22:09.560 --> 22:10.721
whether Shen Congsi

22:10.721 --> 22:12.201
truly has what it takes.

22:12.881 --> 22:14.080
We'll go with Shen Congsi.

22:14.320 --> 22:15.401
You've handled your assignment well.

22:16.080 --> 22:17.001
Thank you, Your Majesty.

23:10.360 --> 23:11.280
This tea...

23:13.241 --> 23:14.401
who sent it again?

23:17.360 --> 23:18.161
I bought it.

23:24.201 --> 23:25.961
I thought your sister-in-law sent it.

23:34.520 --> 23:35.800
Mr. Zhao,

23:36.280 --> 23:38.681
are you still upset
about the appointment?

23:43.441 --> 23:45.681
His Majesty didn't think much
of Shen Congsi

23:46.120 --> 23:47.600
because of all the rumors around him

23:47.600 --> 23:48.681
and formed a prejudice against him.

23:50.161 --> 23:51.600
I simply found a way

23:51.800 --> 23:53.320
to clear up the misunderstanding.

23:54.560 --> 23:55.600
And you, Mr. Zhao,

23:55.760 --> 23:57.120
were rewarded as well.

23:58.201 --> 23:59.641
You weren't doing it for me.

24:00.360 --> 24:01.520
You sided with an outsider

24:02.001 --> 24:04.001
and made it look as though you
and I were divided.

24:05.641 --> 24:06.800
Who's the outsider?

24:11.441 --> 24:13.800
I'm serving His Majesty now.

24:15.161 --> 24:16.401
At least officially,

24:17.441 --> 24:19.241
I'm no longer a man
of the northwest garrisons.

24:21.201 --> 24:22.120
I know

24:22.641 --> 24:24.080
you backed Shen Congsi

24:24.560 --> 24:25.881
because you wanted the northwest

24:26.001 --> 24:27.441
to have someone with no faction
behind him,

24:28.401 --> 24:29.441
so the salt reform

24:29.441 --> 24:31.120
wouldn't fall under
the civil officials' control

24:31.881 --> 24:33.360
and threaten supplies and pay
at the frontier.

24:34.481 --> 24:35.721
But at court,

24:36.681 --> 24:37.760
alliances can shift overnight.

24:39.441 --> 24:40.080
If one day

24:41.721 --> 24:43.681
the northwest and I find ourselves
on opposite sides,

24:44.921 --> 24:45.760
who will you side with?

24:49.520 --> 24:50.641
I know.

24:51.360 --> 24:52.360
But right now,

24:52.481 --> 24:53.760
I'm doing everything I can to mediate

24:53.760 --> 24:55.721
precisely so you never end up
on opposite sides.

24:56.721 --> 24:57.441
Mr. Zhao,

24:57.641 --> 24:59.120
you've met Master Zhao.

25:00.201 --> 25:01.921
Even a wise man like him

25:02.001 --> 25:03.241
knew when to walk away

25:03.241 --> 25:04.520
and become a monk at Tanshui Temple.

25:05.401 --> 25:07.441
Being a powerful minister
is no easy thing.

25:10.001 --> 25:11.881
Serving an emperor
is like walking on thin ice.

25:12.600 --> 25:13.520
Right now,

25:13.600 --> 25:14.641
you're His Majesty's favorite,

25:15.040 --> 25:17.040
and he keeps making exceptions
to promote you.

25:17.320 --> 25:18.401
But the northwest

25:18.721 --> 25:20.120
is still your true power base.

25:20.481 --> 25:22.241
No one tears out their own roots,

25:24.080 --> 25:24.881
unless

25:25.320 --> 25:26.961
you mean to stand alone at court.

25:27.441 --> 25:28.721
But throughout history,

25:30.001 --> 25:32.120
how many men who stood alone
ever met a good end?

25:39.721 --> 25:40.481
Don't worry.

25:43.760 --> 25:45.201
If that day ever comes,

25:50.441 --> 25:51.481
I won't drag you down with me.

26:05.001 --> 26:05.481
Here.

26:09.161 --> 26:11.441
I wonder if you'll be able
to stay tonight.

26:12.961 --> 26:14.921
It's been a long time
since you had my eggplant.

26:17.441 --> 26:18.560
It's only going to be this busy
for a while.

26:19.481 --> 26:20.641
Give it another couple of months.

26:21.241 --> 26:22.360
Once the salt reforms

26:22.360 --> 26:23.401
are settled, things will be easier.

26:27.681 --> 26:29.641
Once Miss Xie and Mr. Zhao are married,

26:30.441 --> 26:31.641
we'll all live together,

26:32.120 --> 26:32.800
and everything will be easier.

26:37.760 --> 26:38.441
Zheng San.

26:39.641 --> 26:40.241
Ready the carriage.

26:40.600 --> 26:41.040
What?

26:41.280 --> 26:42.201
You're leaving already?

26:44.441 --> 26:45.161
Go on.

26:45.441 --> 26:46.080
I'm off, then.

26:51.458 --> 26:52.171
(Yu Residence)

26:52.201 --> 26:54.001
I failed in this matter, Mother.

26:54.441 --> 26:56.360
I couldn't secure the post
for my husband.

26:57.201 --> 26:58.681
Please punish me.

27:00.520 --> 27:01.760
No one blames you.

27:02.681 --> 27:04.161
The Emperor's mind is impossible
to predict.

27:04.401 --> 27:05.721
No one could have expected

27:06.120 --> 27:08.120
His Majesty to appoint Shen Congsi.

27:08.881 --> 27:10.280
Thank you for understanding, Mother.

27:12.320 --> 27:13.120
Mother!

27:14.120 --> 27:15.040
Don't stop me!

27:15.360 --> 27:15.961
Mother!

27:16.320 --> 27:16.800
Mother!

27:17.600 --> 27:18.241
Young Master!

27:24.760 --> 27:26.600
Drunk senseless in broad daylight?

27:27.201 --> 27:28.360
What kind of servant are you?

27:29.641 --> 27:30.481
Forgive me, Madam.

27:31.040 --> 27:32.320
Young Master lost the appointment

27:32.320 --> 27:33.280
and took it hard,

27:33.520 --> 27:34.600
so he had a few drinks.

27:35.481 --> 27:36.760
It's only one post.

27:36.760 --> 27:37.600
So you didn't get it.

27:38.080 --> 27:39.881
Your father can find another path
for you.

27:39.881 --> 27:40.800
There's no need for this.

27:42.441 --> 27:43.040
Mother.

27:47.481 --> 27:48.120
Mother,

27:49.161 --> 27:50.441
let me take a post outside the capital.

27:52.520 --> 27:53.881
At least I'd have some freedom.

27:54.600 --> 27:55.360
Please?

27:55.760 --> 27:56.721
He's had too much to drink.

27:57.161 --> 27:58.600
He's talking nonsense, Mother.

27:59.040 --> 28:00.401
Countless men study their entire lives

28:00.401 --> 28:01.921
and never make it to the imperial court.

28:02.161 --> 28:03.800
You can't fall behind.

28:04.360 --> 28:06.001
Are you that afraid I'll drag you down?

28:07.520 --> 28:09.641
You're already the daughter-in-law
of a Grand Secretary.

28:09.641 --> 28:11.241
What more could you possibly want?

28:11.921 --> 28:14.201
Mother only says these things
for your own good.

28:14.641 --> 28:15.961
If it's all for your own good,

28:15.961 --> 28:17.600
why can't you listen to her for once?

28:18.401 --> 28:20.161
Why take your anger out on me?

28:20.760 --> 28:22.560
Just because it's for my own good,
I have to obey?

28:25.681 --> 28:26.961
By that logic,

28:27.040 --> 28:28.881
I should've listened to her years ago!

28:30.441 --> 28:32.080
But I married you anyway.

28:35.641 --> 28:36.441
Yu Jingxiu.

28:37.441 --> 28:38.681
A few drinks

28:38.760 --> 28:40.161
and you've completely lost your head!

28:40.241 --> 28:40.600
Quick!

28:40.721 --> 28:41.641
Take him back to his room.

28:43.921 --> 28:44.481
Young Master.

28:46.560 --> 28:47.681
It was a mistake...

28:49.641 --> 28:50.721
and a missed chance.

28:52.921 --> 28:53.481
Wait.

28:56.441 --> 28:57.520
Who are you talking about?

28:58.560 --> 28:59.721
What mistake?

29:00.520 --> 29:01.641
What missed chance?

29:02.001 --> 29:03.241
Who did you miss your chance with?

29:11.241 --> 29:12.921
Ever since you came back
from the northwest,

29:14.320 --> 29:15.721
you've been a different man.

29:18.161 --> 29:20.360
You know I've never been able
to tolerate spices.

29:21.320 --> 29:22.441
Yet at the first-birthday banquet,

29:22.441 --> 29:24.241
you brought flatbread seasoned
with them.

29:26.441 --> 29:27.681
I was a fool.

29:29.520 --> 29:31.040
How could I not have realized

29:31.040 --> 29:33.441
someone else had also returned
from the northwest?

29:36.401 --> 29:37.401
That flatbread...

29:40.481 --> 29:41.921
was her favorite?

29:47.401 --> 29:48.760
Take Young Master back to his room.

29:49.520 --> 29:50.201
Young Master.

30:10.481 --> 30:12.201
That's all in the past.

30:12.681 --> 30:14.560
What good will it do him to cling to it?

30:15.441 --> 30:17.641
You're the Young Madam
of the Yu family now.

30:19.881 --> 30:21.441
You knew all along?

30:23.441 --> 30:25.001
Even without Jingxiu,

30:25.001 --> 30:26.241
in this family,

30:26.600 --> 30:27.641
you still have me.

30:28.441 --> 30:29.800
As long as you do as I say,

30:31.320 --> 30:33.040
I'll make sure you're
well taken care of.

30:34.881 --> 30:35.641
Mother...

30:37.961 --> 30:38.881
Mother.

30:47.441 --> 30:49.441
Who exactly

30:49.441 --> 30:51.201
is backing Shen Congsi?

30:52.161 --> 30:53.681
The Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor

30:53.681 --> 30:55.360
is certainly an important post,

30:55.360 --> 30:56.641
but surely not important enough

30:56.961 --> 30:59.360
to bring Master Zhao out of seclusion.

30:59.800 --> 31:01.120
It's a woman.

31:02.201 --> 31:03.320
Fu Tingyun.

31:03.481 --> 31:05.320
Zhao Ling's fiancee.

31:08.360 --> 31:09.881
So it's her.

31:10.520 --> 31:12.120
But is she

31:13.560 --> 31:16.001
a Fu or a Xie?

31:17.401 --> 31:19.360
You've hit on the key point, Master.

31:19.760 --> 31:21.080
Her identity is unclear,

31:21.881 --> 31:23.001
and that's exactly

31:23.001 --> 31:24.681
the weakness we can exploit.

31:31.921 --> 31:32.481
Master,

31:32.560 --> 31:33.520
the Yu family steward is here.

31:39.161 --> 31:40.600
Madam Yu has an important matter

31:40.881 --> 31:42.080
and sent me specially
to deliver this letter.

31:42.681 --> 31:44.481
Fifth Master Fu, she knows
you wish to return to office.

31:44.961 --> 31:45.961
And now

31:45.961 --> 31:47.001
there is an excellent opportunity.

31:47.210 --> 31:48.896
(To Fu Shichang)

31:51.881 --> 31:53.881
Please tell her

31:54.280 --> 31:55.441
that as for my affairs,

31:55.961 --> 31:58.040
my son-in-law will handle them for me.

31:58.201 --> 31:59.760
There's no need for anyone else
to trouble themselves.

32:00.600 --> 32:02.001
Surely you haven't heard?

32:02.560 --> 32:04.040
The post of Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor

32:04.760 --> 32:06.481
has been given to Shen Congsi.

32:10.881 --> 32:12.600
He dared to deceive me.

32:17.120 --> 32:18.800
Please report this

32:18.800 --> 32:19.481
to Madam Yu.

32:19.681 --> 32:20.921
Tell her

32:21.961 --> 32:25.161
I will personally deal with
that disobedient daughter of mine.

32:25.760 --> 32:26.560
Young Madam.

32:26.881 --> 32:29.040
The local gifts you asked us
to send Ninth Young Lady

32:29.360 --> 32:30.641
have been delivered to Xie's shop.

32:30.760 --> 32:32.241
My brother got the post this time

32:32.320 --> 32:33.320
thanks in no small part to her.

32:37.201 --> 32:38.641
Fifth Madam! Young Madam!

32:38.721 --> 32:39.881
Look who's back!

32:44.320 --> 32:45.040
Tingzhuo.

32:45.320 --> 32:46.520
Tingzhuo, you are back.

32:48.360 --> 32:49.040
Mother.

32:58.040 --> 32:59.280
You look thinner.

32:59.441 --> 33:00.280
I've failed you, Mother.

33:01.280 --> 33:02.560
I failed to make the honors list

33:03.120 --> 33:04.120
and bring honor to our family.

33:05.320 --> 33:06.961
Nor was I here to care for you.

33:08.360 --> 33:09.481
Don't say that.

33:10.001 --> 33:11.560
I'm just glad you're home safe.

33:12.001 --> 33:12.641
As for the examinations,

33:12.881 --> 33:13.721
there's no need to rush.

33:17.641 --> 33:18.280
Let me.

33:24.520 --> 33:25.120
Mother.

33:25.641 --> 33:26.161
Take a seat.

33:26.533 --> 33:28.902
(Yu Residence)

33:28.961 --> 33:30.441
When Old Madam Fu was alive,

33:30.560 --> 33:32.441
her greatest wish was
to see you prosper in your career.

33:32.760 --> 33:34.600
Now your daughter and son-in-law
have risen to prominence,

33:34.600 --> 33:35.961
yet they refuse to help you

33:35.961 --> 33:37.520
even secure a single post.

33:38.441 --> 33:40.280
How could Old Madam

33:40.280 --> 33:41.921
possibly rest in peace?

33:42.241 --> 33:43.120
You...

33:43.441 --> 33:45.241
what exactly are you suggesting?

33:47.001 --> 33:48.441
Doesn't your mother have an old servant

33:48.441 --> 33:49.681
who's still alive?

33:51.721 --> 33:53.161
Make sure someone dies over this.

33:53.600 --> 33:56.001
Then we'll see if they still dare
disregard you.

33:56.823 --> 33:59.160
(Yunshe Hut)

33:59.246 --> 34:04.672
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Dowager
Lady Li of the Fu Family)

34:16.361 --> 34:18.080
I, Li, an old servant,

34:18.560 --> 34:20.720
hereby accuse Ninth Young Lady Fu,

34:21.080 --> 34:22.080
Fu Tingyun!

34:22.080 --> 34:23.040
The Fu family?

34:23.321 --> 34:26.321
And the Assistant Censor-in-Chief,
Zhao Ling...

34:26.441 --> 34:28.160
The two of them eloped,

34:28.441 --> 34:29.600
causing

34:30.321 --> 34:32.441
Old Madam Fu's death!

34:32.520 --> 34:33.481
Anyone who beats the Dengwen Drum

34:33.481 --> 34:34.680
has to endure a beating first.

34:34.680 --> 34:35.881
She's risking her life
to make this accusation.

34:35.881 --> 34:37.001
It must be true.

34:40.200 --> 34:41.361
I, Li,

34:41.881 --> 34:44.560
was Old Madam Fu's personal servant.

34:44.801 --> 34:45.680
I beg you, My Lord,

34:46.040 --> 34:47.361
to grant me justice.

34:49.080 --> 34:50.921
This court will not tolerate
reckless accusations.

34:51.321 --> 34:52.240
Without solid evidence,

34:53.001 --> 34:54.881
to accuse a high-ranking official
in the capital

34:55.120 --> 34:55.881
(Fu had an illicit affair with a man.)
constitutes

34:56.001 --> 34:57.120
(She abandoned her family and eloped.)
malicious slander and disturbance.

34:57.481 --> 34:58.881
(Old Madam Fu was devastated.)
You should be punished with the cane.

34:59.881 --> 35:01.120
My Lord, I beg you to judge fairly.

35:01.761 --> 35:02.560
I've served

35:02.921 --> 35:04.120
this household for fifty years.

35:04.441 --> 35:06.361
My fifty years of devotion
to Old Madam Fu

35:06.720 --> 35:08.040
is evidence enough!

35:08.040 --> 35:08.600
Ridiculous!

35:09.441 --> 35:10.040
Take her away.

35:10.401 --> 35:11.160
Twenty strokes.

35:11.177 --> 35:11.770
(Order)

35:11.801 --> 35:12.481
My Lord!

35:13.441 --> 35:15.321
Even if I'm beaten to death today,

35:15.441 --> 35:16.881
I will still seek justice

35:16.881 --> 35:17.961
for Old Madam Fu!

35:18.160 --> 35:19.600
My Lord, I beg you to judge fairly!

35:19.600 --> 35:21.040
Fifth Master Fu

35:21.040 --> 35:22.361
is such a devoted son.

35:22.481 --> 35:23.921
He's mourned for seven years.

35:23.921 --> 35:25.401
How could he have raised

35:25.441 --> 35:27.401
such a heartless daughter?

35:27.680 --> 35:28.680
Exactly.

35:28.680 --> 35:30.321
The two of them actually eloped.

35:30.327 --> 35:31.046
What a disgrace to the family.

35:31.070 --> 35:32.283
(Fu Residence)

35:32.321 --> 35:34.281
Even the cruelest parent
wouldn't hurt their own child.

35:34.520 --> 35:36.801
How could you sink this low?

35:37.120 --> 35:38.640
You know better than I do

35:39.680 --> 35:41.240
how Mother really died.

35:42.120 --> 35:43.281
After she fell ill,

35:43.281 --> 35:44.881
she clearly wanted to return to Huaying.

35:45.080 --> 35:46.720
Why did she stay in the capital?

35:47.080 --> 35:48.001
Wasn't it

35:48.001 --> 35:50.001
to mourn here in the capital

35:50.001 --> 35:51.240
and secure your future?

35:51.240 --> 35:52.040
Shut your mouth!

35:53.441 --> 35:54.520
You vicious woman!

35:55.640 --> 35:59.560
I built a mourning hut and mourned
my mother for seven years.

35:59.560 --> 36:00.801
I won't let you defile my devotion!

36:01.240 --> 36:01.921
Fine.

36:03.080 --> 36:05.321
Then let's take this to court

36:06.240 --> 36:08.441
and see who's really lying.

36:08.720 --> 36:09.921
Stop!

36:14.321 --> 36:15.640
Listen to me.

36:15.640 --> 36:16.560
In the Fu family,

36:16.560 --> 36:19.240
you have no say in anything.

36:21.801 --> 36:22.600
Tingzhuo,

36:23.680 --> 36:25.560
take your mother back to her room.

36:25.720 --> 36:27.921
She's unwell and shouldn't be out.

36:27.921 --> 36:29.200
If she leaves her room,

36:29.200 --> 36:30.680
you'll answer to me.

36:30.921 --> 36:31.520
You...

36:52.883 --> 36:56.363
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Dowager
Lady Li of the Fu Family)

36:57.120 --> 36:58.881
I hear Miss Xie

36:58.881 --> 37:00.160
is actually a Fu.

37:00.481 --> 37:02.481
She's the Fu family's Ninth Young Lady.

37:02.640 --> 37:04.361
She and Commander Zhao

37:04.520 --> 37:05.441
were...

37:05.441 --> 37:06.441
you know.

37:07.321 --> 37:08.401
Old Madam Fu

37:08.401 --> 37:10.600
was supposedly driven to her death
by the two of them.

37:11.321 --> 37:12.881
Old Madam's personal attendant

37:13.160 --> 37:14.921
risked punishment for accusing
her masters

37:15.040 --> 37:16.640
and was beaten to death in court,

37:16.720 --> 37:18.401
all to bring her grievance
before the Chengqian Prefecture.

37:18.720 --> 37:19.881
Just imagine

37:19.881 --> 37:21.441
how outrageous their actions
must have been.

37:22.040 --> 37:24.441
Young Madam Yu, you're
from Huaying County, aren't you?

37:24.481 --> 37:26.240
Then you and Miss Xie

37:26.240 --> 37:27.640
must have known each other for years.

37:28.040 --> 37:29.321
Whether we know each other

37:29.481 --> 37:30.961
isn't for me alone to say.

37:31.520 --> 37:33.401
It also depends on whether she'd care
to admit it.

37:33.441 --> 37:35.001
The way you say that,

37:35.001 --> 37:37.481
you clearly know something we don't.

37:37.761 --> 37:38.720
Do tell us.

37:38.921 --> 37:40.001
Miss Xie is here.

37:40.720 --> 37:41.600
Miss Xie.

37:44.321 --> 37:46.361
Madam Zhou, you ordered something
from Xie's shop,

37:46.560 --> 37:47.720
so I brought it over myself.

37:47.881 --> 37:48.520
Right.

37:48.761 --> 37:49.761
In a few days,

37:49.761 --> 37:51.560
it will be
the Grand Empress Dowager's birthday.

37:51.881 --> 37:52.600
So I specially asked

37:52.600 --> 37:53.481
Miss Xie

37:53.481 --> 37:55.640
to procure a white-jade Guanyin
from the South Sea.

37:56.120 --> 37:58.001
I wonder what birthday gift

37:58.001 --> 37:59.441
your household has prepared, Miss Xie?

38:00.001 --> 38:02.361
Miss Xie is only a commoner now.

38:03.040 --> 38:04.600
And she and Commander Zhao
aren't even formally married yet.

38:05.321 --> 38:06.881
So this imperial birthday banquet...

38:07.801 --> 38:09.120
I suppose you won't be able to attend?

38:20.441 --> 38:22.080
How kind of you all to be so concerned.

38:22.921 --> 38:24.441
Having been recorded in the county
gazetteer three times,

38:24.441 --> 38:25.441
I was granted the honor
of entering the palace

38:25.680 --> 38:27.761
to celebrate the Grand Empress
Dowager's birthday.

38:28.120 --> 38:30.200
I've been helping the wife
of Gandu Circuit's Regional Commander

38:30.200 --> 38:31.361
prepare the birthday gifts.

38:32.720 --> 38:34.040
I happened to have some free time today,

38:34.040 --> 38:36.120
so I took the opportunity
to deliver this jade Guanyin

38:36.281 --> 38:37.720
and join you ladies for tea.

38:38.441 --> 38:40.761
No wonder you've traveled
so far and wide, Miss Xie.

38:41.040 --> 38:42.560
Women like us who stay
within the household

38:42.560 --> 38:44.281
may preserve our reputations,

38:44.640 --> 38:46.281
but we miss out on the wider world.

38:47.001 --> 38:47.761
Indeed.

38:49.031 --> 38:51.017
(Wanfang Garden)

38:51.520 --> 38:53.560
They were clearly trying
to humiliate you.

38:54.401 --> 38:55.961
What they said wasn't entirely wrong.

38:57.080 --> 38:58.321
I never expected

38:59.080 --> 39:00.361
that in just one day,

39:00.441 --> 39:01.720
the rumors would spread this far.

39:02.401 --> 39:03.600
Your father

39:03.680 --> 39:05.120
really went for the throat this time.

39:05.921 --> 39:07.401
What does he hope to gain from this?

39:08.921 --> 39:10.401
If this scandal really keeps me

39:10.401 --> 39:11.441
from attending the palace banquet,

39:12.281 --> 39:13.321
then from now on,

39:13.441 --> 39:15.401
no one in the capital may want anything
to do with me.

39:16.881 --> 39:18.001
But that doesn't matter.

39:18.921 --> 39:20.200
What worries me is that someone

39:20.200 --> 39:21.481
may use this scandal against us

39:21.680 --> 39:23.361
and get the Censorate
to impeach Mr. Zhao.

39:24.481 --> 39:26.160
The hearing is in three days.

39:27.481 --> 39:29.040
Then let's go talk to Mr. Zhao.

39:29.240 --> 39:31.080
My family caused all this.

39:31.560 --> 39:33.441
I'm afraid it may jeopardize his career.

39:35.160 --> 39:36.481
How am I supposed to face him?

39:39.120 --> 39:39.680
Mr. Zhao,

39:40.240 --> 39:41.600
someone from Chengqian Prefecture
came with a summons.

39:41.600 --> 39:42.441
They said someone from the Fu family

39:42.441 --> 39:43.321
has filed a complaint against you

39:43.321 --> 39:44.281
and you must appear in court

39:44.281 --> 39:45.040
for a hearing in three days.

39:46.560 --> 39:48.120
So I was the real target after all.

39:48.401 --> 39:49.881
They're merely using the Fu family

39:50.080 --> 39:51.441
as a means to get at me.

39:53.240 --> 39:53.921
What about Miss Xie?

39:54.321 --> 39:55.441
She had Zheng San

39:55.441 --> 39:56.321
bring you a packet of herbs.

40:03.321 --> 40:04.240
It's danggui, meaning return...

40:04.881 --> 40:05.481
Mr. Zhao,

40:05.921 --> 40:07.040
are we going back or not?

40:08.961 --> 40:10.361
Something this serious happens,

40:11.481 --> 40:12.640
and she still won't just say
what she means.

40:14.441 --> 40:15.761
Go to the herbalist's for me.

40:16.801 --> 40:17.640
Buy a packet

40:19.040 --> 40:20.441
of kushen, the bitterness,
and send it back.

40:21.103 --> 40:21.763
Huh?

40:24.120 --> 40:25.881
And if she sends back a packet
of red beans, meaning she misses you,

40:26.080 --> 40:27.441
what will you send her then?

40:28.361 --> 40:29.761
Why not just buy some gelsemium elegan?

40:31.441 --> 40:32.720
Are you an idiot?

40:32.720 --> 40:33.120
I...

40:34.120 --> 40:35.520
Mr. Zhao just wants her
to know he's hurt.

40:35.520 --> 40:37.040
He doesn't actually want
to break things off with her.

40:37.040 --> 40:37.600
Honestly, you...

40:40.560 --> 40:41.680
We'll go buy the herbs now.

40:42.120 --> 40:42.560
Let's go.

40:55.600 --> 40:56.401
Your Majesty,

40:56.560 --> 40:58.080
I have a memorial to present.

40:58.401 --> 41:00.560
Zhao Ling, Assistant Commander
of the Capital Guard,

41:00.720 --> 41:01.761
seven years ago,

41:01.761 --> 41:03.481
lured a daughter of the Fu family
into eloping with him,

41:03.720 --> 41:05.321
causing Old Madam Fu

41:05.321 --> 41:06.560
to die from the shock.

41:06.961 --> 41:08.361
The Fu family's servant, Li,

41:08.361 --> 41:10.441
risked her life to beat
the Dengwen Drum and seek justice.

41:10.961 --> 41:11.680
Such conduct,

41:11.881 --> 41:13.441
which violates the most basic
moral order,

41:14.200 --> 41:15.961
must be severely punished.

41:16.441 --> 41:18.080
I beg Your Majesty to judge wisely.

41:18.720 --> 41:19.720
Is this matter

41:20.441 --> 41:21.481
true?

41:22.001 --> 41:23.080
Which Fu family?

41:23.921 --> 41:25.120
Could there be some misunderstanding?

41:26.481 --> 41:27.600
Your Majesty,
I've been wrongfully accused.

41:28.401 --> 41:29.160
Zhao Ling,

41:29.441 --> 41:31.961
I recall your marriage to Miss Xie

41:32.080 --> 41:33.720
was arranged by your elders.

41:34.520 --> 41:35.720
When Miss Xie fell into trouble,

41:36.441 --> 41:37.961
her mother entrusted her to my care.

41:40.801 --> 41:42.080
I have the token to prove it.

41:42.761 --> 41:44.321
If the marriage had the elders' approval

41:44.441 --> 41:45.761
and there is a token to prove it,

41:45.921 --> 41:47.361
how can this be called abduction?

41:50.001 --> 41:50.640
Your Majesty,

41:51.240 --> 41:52.560
the difficulty with this case is that

41:52.720 --> 41:53.560
the servant

41:53.680 --> 41:55.001
is already dead.

41:55.321 --> 41:56.401
A life has been lost,

41:56.801 --> 41:57.921
so the truth of what happened

41:58.001 --> 41:59.321
must still be properly established.

42:02.321 --> 42:03.001
Your Majesty,

42:03.001 --> 42:03.761
I believe

42:03.881 --> 42:05.921
this concerns the moral order
of the court.

42:06.881 --> 42:09.160
Though Commander Zhao
is Your Majesty's favorite,

42:09.441 --> 42:10.881
if these charges prove true,

42:10.881 --> 42:12.281
he should be severely punished
according to law

42:12.281 --> 42:13.841
to uphold the standards of the court.

42:15.881 --> 42:16.961
Commander Zhao,

42:17.361 --> 42:19.961
you can't even manage
your own household affairs.

42:19.961 --> 42:21.200
What qualifies you

42:21.200 --> 42:23.080
to serve as Assistant Censor-in-Chief?

42:24.001 --> 42:26.001
The salt administration is vital
to the state.

42:26.001 --> 42:28.040
I beg Your Majesty to reconsider

42:28.640 --> 42:29.961
and appoint a more worthy candidate

42:29.961 --> 42:31.281
to oversee the reforms.

42:37.761 --> 42:38.441
Grand Secretary Tian?

42:41.921 --> 42:42.881
I

42:43.160 --> 42:45.040
have disgraced the court.

42:45.720 --> 42:48.240
Age has weakened me,

42:48.361 --> 42:49.801
and I can no longer stand for long.

42:50.001 --> 42:51.001
For me

42:51.001 --> 42:52.680
to grow so feeble-minded...

42:53.080 --> 42:54.560
I truly

42:54.560 --> 42:57.761
have no face to remain at court.

42:57.761 --> 42:59.801
Look at this mess.

43:00.080 --> 43:01.441
See to Grand Secretary Tian first.

43:01.560 --> 43:02.761
Set this matter aside for now.

43:03.001 --> 43:04.001
We'll discuss it later.

43:04.921 --> 43:06.841
Court is dismissed.

43:08.520 --> 43:10.761
Farewell, Your Majesty.

43:18.720 --> 43:19.160
My Lord.

43:21.160 --> 43:22.160
Thank you, My Lord,

43:22.841 --> 43:23.720
for helping me out back there.

43:25.961 --> 43:27.640
Wasn't I

43:28.160 --> 43:29.640
asleep just now?

43:31.881 --> 43:33.520
How did I help you?

43:36.921 --> 43:38.761
You were all making such a commotion.

43:39.040 --> 43:40.441
What were you arguing about?

43:48.303 --> 43:50.970
(Next Episode)

43:51.640 --> 43:53.481
You two ungrateful, unfilial wretches.

43:53.801 --> 43:55.001
You drove your grandmother to her death,

43:55.281 --> 43:56.240
defied your elders,

43:56.520 --> 43:57.361
one a eloped woman,

43:57.401 --> 43:58.361
the other a libertine.

43:58.361 --> 43:59.520
He is no libertine.

43:59.520 --> 44:00.881
Nor is she a eloped woman.

44:01.640 --> 44:03.520
On the children's
Eight-Character Marriage Slip,

44:03.921 --> 44:06.321
the most important thing
is the parents' blessing.

44:06.600 --> 44:08.680
What does "a parent's command"
truly mean?

44:09.640 --> 44:11.761
It means I bless my children
and wish them happiness,

44:12.080 --> 44:14.961
not that their happiness requires
my permission.

44:15.361 --> 44:16.401
You want the Eight-Character Slip?

44:16.921 --> 44:19.481
Not unless the ancestral hall's plaque
crashes down.

44:33.800 --> 44:38.120
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

44:41.720 --> 44:46.080
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

44:48.200 --> 44:52.840
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

44:53.080 --> 44:55.880
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

44:57.040 --> 45:01.680
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

45:04.880 --> 45:11.720
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

45:12.600 --> 45:19.120
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

45:20.080 --> 45:23.520
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

45:24.040 --> 45:28.240
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

45:28.520 --> 45:34.200
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

45:46.320 --> 45:50.200
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

45:54.120 --> 45:58.120
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

45:59.840 --> 46:04.520
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

46:04.840 --> 46:07.520
♪Kept close within my heart♪

46:08.600 --> 46:13.440
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

46:16.960 --> 46:23.880
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

46:24.760 --> 46:31.240
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

46:32.120 --> 46:35.640
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:36.080 --> 46:40.440
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:40.640 --> 46:46.360
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
